                "text_7CM4Lq": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>The industry spent decades making supplements that technically work but produce effects too subtle to register. People felt nothing, assumed nootropics were a scam, and went looking for something they could actually feel. Most of them found pills that weren’t theirs to take.</p><p>EZ-A was built for that person. Not with more caffeine. Not with a louder label. But with a formula that actually does something. Turns out your brain switching on has a feeling. </p><p>And once you know it, you can’t unknow it.</p>",
                    "width": "fit-content",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
